# FormFlare needs no secrets to deploy.
#
# Every UNCOMMENTED line in this file becomes a required secret prompt in the
# "Deploy to Cloudflare" flow, and the example value ships to production.
# Keep everything commented out.
#
# Session keys are generated during /setup and stored in D1.
# Turnstile keys are configured per form in the dashboard.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional hardening
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SETUP_TOKEN — when set, /setup additionally requires this token, closing the
# window between deploy and first setup in which someone who finds the URL could
# claim the instance. Leave it unset for the normal one-click flow (the first-run
# lock still applies). To use it, add it as a secret after deploying and open
# /setup?token=YOUR_TOKEN
#
# SETUP_TOKEN=change-me
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local development only — never set in production
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# FORMFLARE_DEV_SEED=1
